│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ observable_aligned_calibrator                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ This approach removes the high-capacity variational transformation and treats the         │
│                          │ dataset-provided mean Z-Z correlator as a sufficient quantum feature. Each block contains │
│                          │ one fixed CZ gate. Because CZ commutes with every Z-Z readout and the block is repeated   │
│                          │ six times, the six identical involutions cancel exactly, leaving the prepared state       │
│                          │ unchanged. Training therefore reduces to a two-parameter affine calibration of the fixed  │
│                          │ quantum statistic.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This provides strong regularization, eliminates circuit-parameter optimization and        │
│                          │ barren-plateau risk, reduces the total parameter count from 146 to 2, and lowers the      │
│                          │ repeated circuit from 186 gates to 6 while preserving the classifier’s relevant           │
│                          │ observable.                                                                               │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.1764                                                                                   │
