│ patch_description        │ Replace the 24-parameter block with a single fixed CZ gate. Because the identical block   │
│                          │ is repeated six times and CZ is self-inverse, the six applications cancel exactly,        │
│                          │ leaving the prepared state unchanged before measurement. This directly exposes the        │
│                          │ dataset-provided mean Z-Z readout to the trainable gain and bias. It reduces the model    │
│                          │ from 146 parameters to only 2, removes unnecessary circuit optimization, preserves the    │
│                          │ most relevant observable, and should substantially improve parameter efficiency and       │
│                          │ convergence while limiting overfitting.                                                   │
