│ patch_description        │ Remove the collective RZ layer and retain one shared global RY angle per block followed   │
│                          │ by the CZ chain. The prior results show that this one-angle block already achieves        │
│                          │ perfect train, validation, and test accuracy with faster convergence. Since Z rotations   │
│                          │ are comparatively weak for a final Z-Z readout and double the circuit-parameter count     │
