│ patch_description        │ Collapse the variational circuit to the minimum valid ansatz: one fixed CZ gate. Because  │
│                          │ the block is repeated six times, CZ is applied an even number of times and cancels        │
│                          │ exactly, leaving the input state unchanged. The classifier therefore trains only the gain │
