│                          │ perfect accuracy while remaining close to the identity, indicating that the fixed         │
│                          │ correlators contain the relevant signal. This change reduces total trainable parameters   │
│                          │ from 8 to 2, gate count from 138 to 6, and depth substantially, maximizing parameter      │
