│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ readout_only_identity                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Remove all circuit parameters and reduce the block to one fixed CZ gate. Because the      │
│                          │ block is repeated six times and CZ is self-inverse, the six applications cancel exactly,  │
│                          │ leaving the prepared state unchanged before measurement. The model therefore learns only  │
│                          │ the gain and bias of the already highly informative fixed correlator mean. This reduces   │
│                          │ the total parameter count from 8 to 2, raises parameter efficiency substantially,         │
│                          │ eliminates unnecessary circuit optimization, and should accelerate convergence while      │
│                          │ preserving the demonstrated perfect classification when the raw readout is linearly       │
│                          │ separable.                                                                                │
