│                          │ each RY layer does not commute with the surrounding CZ layers, while keeping the minimum  │
│                          │ one circuit parameter per repeat. This maintains the favorable 8-parameter count and fast │
│                          │ single-axis convergence while reducing the circuit from 138 to 90 gates and eliminating   │
│                          │ the final RZ layer that commutes with the Z-Z readout.                                    │
